Package: cudaGlmnet
Type: Package
Title: Minimal GPU Gaussian Lasso via rcupp
Version: 0.0.0.9002
Authors@R: person("Joe", "Zhu", email = "sha.joe.zhu@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Joe Zhu [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Joe Zhu <sha.joe.zhu@gmail.com>
Description: A glmnet-like interface for the Gaussian lasso solved by GPU
    FISTA through the low-level 'rcupp' package. Provides lambda paths,
    cross-validation, standardization and an intercept, with coef/predict
    methods using glmnet-style 's' selection. The single fixed-lambda
    cuda_lasso() entry point is retained as the numerical reference path.
    Sparse x, other families and elastic-net mixing are future work.
